            "review_title": "Review at Lim Veggie Bistro",
            "review_text": "Mobile52019682442\n2 contributions\n0\nHigh quality delicious veggie food\nApr 2026 • Couples\nDelicious fresh inventive food! We had the green mango salad, corn with rice crackers and hanoi bun cha, larb and mixes satay noodles with wontons ( wasn't peanut satay though) and all meals were of excellent quality! Highly recommend, some of the best food of our trip only wish we had discovered it a day earlier so we could have tried more meals\nWritten April 6, 2026",
