            "review_title": "Review at Lim Veggie Bistro",
            "review_text": "dietris2017\nBuenos Aires, Argentina58 contributions\n0\nBest vegetarian! And THE place to try veggie food for carnivores\nJan 2025 • Friends\nA superb and quiet spot in the buzzling city. Being non-vegetarians we went there already 3 times (lunch and dinners) to explore all dishes from the menue. There is not one to miss!!!\nThe food is so tasty and has a great variety, the drinks are fresh and excellent and the service is exceptional and super friendly.\nThis is the place to convert to vegetarian without being tortured with tofu in variations with no taste (like common in Europe).\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nEverything is so tasty\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 18, 2025",
